import{_ as o,o as t,c as a,a2 as r}from"./chunks/framework.CyZTVJbV.js";const v=JSON.parse('{"title":"","description":"","frontmatter":{},"headers":[],"relativePath":"announcements/v1.22/x-thread-ja.md","filePath":"announcements/v1.22/x-thread-ja.md"}'),i={name:"announcements/v1.22/x-thread-ja.md"};function n(d,e,c,l,s,p){return t(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[r('<p>1/ kiwa v1.22 リリース — Auth 深化 II milestone。 v1.21 で 4 protocol adapter を pure mock として land した (WebAuthn L3 + Passkey + OAuth 2.1 + OIDC) 後、 v1.22 では <strong>real driver</strong> をその上に layer 化。 Keycloak testcontainers (OIDC + Federation) / oauth2-mock-server testcontainers (OAuth 2.1) / Chrome caBLE hybrid transport (Passkey)。 mock は first-line contract のまま、 real driver は second-line fidelity check として並走。 mock 経路の &lt; 5 ms per test latency budget は完全維持。</p><p>2/ 3 execution mode SSOT (<code>docs/concepts/real-driver-testing.md</code>) — <code>mock only</code> (default、 <code>KIWA_MODE</code> 未 set) = 純 <code>@kiwa-test/auth</code> mock、 network 0、 ~1 ms per test。 全 PR は本 mode で走る。 <code>real-optional</code> (<code>KIWA_MODE=real-optional</code>) = real driver 試行、 container URL 欠時は mock に fallback + warning。 laptop friendly。 <code>real-required</code> (<code>KIWA_MODE=real</code> + <code>KEYCLOAK_URL</code> / <code>OAUTH21_BOOTSTRAP=1</code> / Chrome caBLE flag) = driver 欠時 fail hard、 nightly CI + release smoke 用。</p><p>3/ v1.22-1 dogfood-oidc-federation に Keycloak testcontainers real driver 追加。 Docker Keycloak 26 起動 + realm import + client registration + JWKS endpoint + Federation trust anchor 完了実装。 v1.21-4 fidelity harness 16 軸のうち axes 1 (Discovery metadata field parity) + 3 (JWKS rotation with kid rollover) が real 走査済、 <code>.well-known/openid-configuration</code> field 1 対 1 一致確認。</p><p>4/ v1.22-2 dogfood-oauth21-provider に oauth2-mock-server testcontainers real driver 追加。 5 endpoint (/authorize + /token + /revoke + /userinfo + /.well-known/oauth-authorization-server) + PKCE S256 + DPoP + refresh rotation + revocation cascade が real 走査済。 Bug 1 fix ... /authorize post-adapter error redirect (RFC 6749 §4.1.2.1) の state parameter 不整合を発見、 v1.22-2 で mock を RFC + real oauth2-mock-server 挙動に合わせて修正。</p><p>5/ v1.22-3 dogfood-oidc-federation Nuxt 3 RP full flow + a11y axe-core gate。 RP journey ... login button → OP redirect → callback → userinfo panel → logout。 Playwright + <code>@axe-core/playwright</code> で WCAG 2.1 AA + WAI-ARIA authoring practice 準拠検査。 release gate 7 軸 a11y branch を N/A (v1.21 skeleton) → PASS (v1.22 full interactive surface) に切替。 WCAG blocker は rule 別 reason 出力で triage 可能。</p><p>6/ v1.22-4 dogfood-webauthn-passkey-app caBLE hybrid transport 5 軸 fidelity harness。 CTAP2 hybrid transport (Cloud-Assisted BLE) real device flow ... QR gen + BLE handshake + WebSocket tunnel + credential migration + signature roundtrip。 Playwright + Chrome <code>--enable-features=WebAuthenticationRemoteDesktopSupport</code>。 40 new test で <code>@kiwa-test/auth</code> 新 caBLE mock vs real Chrome + Android phone pair の 5 軸 fidelity 検証、 phone → laptop credential 移送が mock と real で同じ挙動。</p><p>7/ v1.22-5 Federation JWKS rotation real e2e — real Keycloak OP + Nuxt 3 RP + real JWKS endpoint (public URL + HTTP cache invalidation)。 kid rotation → RP side JWKS refresh → id_token verify continue の連鎖を real network で単 end-to-end chain で計測。 axes 4a-4d (inside window / past retention / multi-rotation retention / fresh active key after rotation) 全 real coverage。 fidelity gate PASS = mock が real Keycloak から silent drift しない guarantee。</p><p>8/ 1 npm minor bump — <code>@kiwa-test/auth</code> v0.4.0 → v0.5.0 を npm publish。 additive-only ... v1.21 setup entry point の signature 完全維持、 v1.22 は <code>realDriver</code> option + caBLE method を並列追加。 docs ... 2 tutorial (37 real driver testing + 38 Passkey caBLE flow) + additive migration v1.21 → v1.22 + concept doc <code>real-driver-testing.md</code> (3 execution mode SSOT + fidelity axis catalog)。 VitePress + gh-pages publish。 Roadmap ... <a href="https://github.com/cardene777/kiwa#roadmap" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://github.com/cardene777/kiwa#roadmap</a> — v1.11 → v1.12 → v1.13 → v1.14 → v1.15 → v1.16 → v1.17 → v1.18 → v1.19 → v1.20 → v1.21 → v1.22 の 12 milestone 連続完遂。</p>',8)])])}const h=o(i,[["render",n]]);export{v as __pageData,h as default};
